<li><a href="../../pkgs/morphir-host/library_build.mbt">Host build leases and evidence validation</a></li>
<li><a href="../../apps/morphir/build-provider/library-build.mjs">Process build provider and dependency restrictions</a></li>
<li><a href="../../pkgs/morphir-scheme/backend/runtime.mbt">Local evaluator entry API</a></li>
<li><a href="../../pkgs/morphir-host/embedding/README.md">Existing embedded compiler capabilities</a></li>
<li><a href="morphir-moonbit-backend.html">E1 design and Ion rationale</a></li>
</ul>
